# Staging area for freshly generated art, before it is filed
assets/_inbox/

# Third-party reference material. Deliberately NOT committed:
#  - solo-leveling-*.png are copyrighted publisher art, used only as private
#    direction references
#  - off-direction/* are rejected generations that have the Solo Leveling title
#    baked into the image
# Both categories contradict the IP rule in CLAUDE.md, so they stay local.
assets/references/

# The unabridged wording of the two generalised log entries. This repo is public
# so the art can be served by URL; the original phrasing names specific private
# habits and reads as a confession when it is not one.
PRIVATE-NOTES.md

